  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "SLO definitions",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Donation service reliability objectives\n- **Availability SLI:** successful business HTTP requests (non-5xx) / total business HTTP requests. **SLO: 99.9% over 30 days.**\n- **Latency SLI:** business HTTP requests completed in **\u2264 500 ms** / total business HTTP requests. **SLO: 99.0% over 30 days.**\n- Health, readiness and metrics endpoints are excluded from the business SLIs.\n- **Error budget:** availability SLO allows 0.1% unsuccessful business requests in the 30-day window."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Availability SLI (30d)",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0.99,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.995
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.999
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "sizing": "auto",
        "minVizWidth": 75,
        "minVizHeight": 75
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "solidarytech:donation:availability_ratio30d",
          "legendFormat": "Availability SLI (30d)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Target: 99.9% successful business requests over 30 days."
    },
